WEBVTT

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:24.920
Kado.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.270
Shindo-san!

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:06.980
For some reason, Yaha-kui 
zaShunina wants to meet you.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:11.590
It may be due to some mental state he's 
acquired while being in this universe.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:15.890
He will approach you defenseless, I'm sure,

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.670
with no awareness of the Fregonics generator

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.770
and Fregonics nullifier that you're wearing.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.970
You just have to do it once.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.110
Just take one hit from him,

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:32.330
and pierce his shields a single time.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:34.190
And then...

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:38.220
I wonder if I'll be able to surprise him.

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:44.870
<i>He left me down here to make 
zaShunina less cautious.</i>

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:49.090
<i>This is all an attempt to surprise him.</i>

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:53.380
Shindo, what shall we talk about?

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.710
There are many things I want to talk about,

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:58.300
but the vital topics now are probably...

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:00.620
The universe and humanity...

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.540
The anisotropic and 
the anisotropic beings.

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:06.660
In other words, you and me.

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:22.590
Can we get through?

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:25.700
Satellite communications are totally offline.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:29.460
Surface communications are 
gradually coming back online.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:32.990
From Tokyo to Yamanashi, Shizuoka...

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:36.970
In other words, Kado's spread that far.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.950
We'll turn to the government for orders.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.190
As soon as they respond,

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:43.040
we'll start evacuating civilians 
and securing the area.

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:43.970
Yes, sir!

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.100
Can we really get out?

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:57.820
As of this moment, I am declaring 
a national state of disaster.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.780
I request that the SDF roll out 
its disaster response teams.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:03.470
Can we get in touch with Shindo Kojiro?

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:05.740
He's been missing for 17 minutes.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.750
And we can't get a hold of 
Yaha-kui zaShunina, either.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:13.580
I always thought that the "universe,"

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:17.830
the information cocoon, 
had incredibly few dimensions,

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.150
and was composed of a very small 
number of information units,

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.940
which in total would never 
match the anisotropic.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.730
But humanity, a singularity,

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:31.350
created more information than the 
universe's processing power should allow.

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.310
So it was illogical, then?

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.590
What is it that makes humanity unique?

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:41.750
I had a theory regarding that.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.900
This is a copy of you.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:56.130
When created, it was completely 
identical to you, information-wise.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:03:59.960
But this is not Shindo.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:02.470
And...

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:06.620
This is a copy of me that I just made.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:09.940
It is completely identical 
to me, information-wise,

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:12.480
and the exact same as me,
or at least should be.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.730
But this wasn't the same, either.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:21.490
I thought to myself that this must 
be the nature of the singularity.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:25.180
The power to assign different 
values to the exact same thing.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:30.740
The power to give a thing that is only "one"
information amounting to more than one.

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:34.610
That is the unprecedented 
power humanity has created.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.720
And its source seems to be

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.420
you and me.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.550
It comes from within us.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:55.550
Gonno-san, what does the anisotropic 
being want to do with us?

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:59.190
If it was humanity's enemy all along,

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:01.230
then all the stuff we've reported...

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.480
Listen to me.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:05.410
What's important isn't if it's good or bad.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.700
There's only one thing 
we should be reporting.

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:10.030
The truth!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.980
Start recording.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.080
Record everything that's happening!

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.520
That is our right answer!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:29.100
Shindo, will you come to 
the anisotropic and help me

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.850
learn more about this special power?

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:37.940
Even in this tiny universe, humanity has 
created incredible amounts of information.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:41.130
So if humanity reaches the anisotropic,

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:44.190
how many miracles will they show me?

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.270
I'll make your anisotropic 
transformation successful!

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.020
I promise!

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:51.090
So, Shindo...

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.080
Come to the anisotropic with me!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:56.540
I can't.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:01.210
zaShunina, I can't go to the anisotropic.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:03.590
Why?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.310
I'm not saying that I don't 
like the anisotropic.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.980
An unknown world...

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:10.830
A dimension beyond the universe.

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:15.860
As a human, I'd be lying if 
I said I wasn't interested.

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.370
But more than that...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:25.400
I love this universe, 
and the world I was born in.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.500
There are things here 
that are precious to me.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:39.770
You are trying to sacrifice humanity and 
the universe to fill a void in yourself.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:44.880
Even if that's what humanity 
was originally made for...

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:49.880
Even if the anisotropic beings 
were humanity's creators, I...

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:53.300
refuse to accept that!

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:00.670
Even if humanity doesn't want it,

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:04.570
I can achieve the anisotropic 
transformation by force.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.380
You people can't stop me!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:11.220
Shindo, I can...

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:15.820
take you to the anisotropic by force!

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:22.210
zaShunina!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.170
You understand, don't you?

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:29.450
That what you're saying is the wrong answer.

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:42.220
Shindo...

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:44.740
You are you.

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:47.910
No one can replace you.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:52.600
A singularity that possesses information 
beyond its calculation limits...

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.180
An irreplaceable individual.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.620
Transforming you by force 
would be meaningless.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.870
If I do that,

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.370
it will destroy your heart!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:08.580
It will destroy the way of 
living that is Shindo Kojiro!

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:13.060
I don't want that!

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.900
zaShunina...

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.810
I understand now.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:39.550
I can't take you to the anisotropic.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.410
What will you do, then?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.170
It's strange...

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:56.430
This conclusion came from within me, 
not the universe or the anisotropic.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:01.430
You really have become like a human.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.180
I will end you...

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.440
With my own hands.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.410
Perfect.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:12.110
I've been meaning to punch you myself.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.130
Why?

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.540
Because you're being stupid.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.820
So I'll stop you, even if it 
means I have to punch you.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.270
Because you're

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.160
my friend.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:28.020
Friend?

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.600
zaShunina!

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:23.140
How...

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:26.680
A Fregonics nullifier.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:31.820
And a Fregonics generator.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:34.340
Splendid.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.860
Humanity's technology has come so far.

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:42.200
But they cannot function if 
their power source is broken.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:47.620
The device is covered in Fregonics.

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:52.380
Even you shouldn't be able to 
alter it from the inside...

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.460
I can't.

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:56.970
To affect what's inside a Fregonics barrier,

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:59.490
one must first destroy it.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:04.790
But if you were inside it from the start,

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:06.370
that isn't necessarily true.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.020
Then...

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:12.480
I taught Shinawa Kanata 
how to make a new Wam.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:21.360
These Wam are connected to hyperspace.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.190
I predicted that, with her capabilities,

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:35.000
she would be able to make a 
device that nullified Fregonics.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:38.030
And that you would use it.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.630
All of it...

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:45.080
Yes, unfortunately, I was exactly right.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.930
I'm sorry, Shindo.

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.190
I'm really sorry...

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:53.610
So am I.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:57.450
I couldn't surprise you.

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:06.850
Shindo...

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:10.600
zaShunina.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:41.960
No!

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:06.430
Kado.

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:13.420
The transformation will begin soon.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.810
Humanity will reach the only answer,

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.750
the right answer,

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:31.030
when I send a single human 
to the anisotropic.

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:39.460
But, Shindo...

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.250
I'll be lonely.

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:50.410
Yaha-kui zaShunina.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:57.270
Kojiro-san's plan just 
reached successful completion.

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.230
What are you talking about?

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:08.450
A car? Here?

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.080
Two things were required.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:18.000
First, to make you think that 
all our plans had failed.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:25.170
Don't you dare get between me and Shindo,

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:26.510
you lower dimensions!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.350
And the other...

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:38.530
To give you more information 
than you've ever seen.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:49.780
I see.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:53.410
Shun-kun was exactly right about you.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:01.920
That can't be...

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:06.050
We used the Nanomis-hein 
to alter relative time.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:10.750
In a very specific area,

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.220
in this very short time,

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.640
sixteen years have passed.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.750
<i>Hey, zaShunina.</i>

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.210
Shindo!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.290
<i>I'll introduce you.</i>

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.100
<i>This is Saraka-san's and my daughter.</i>

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:53.500
<i>She is the universe's new answer, 
one superior to both</i>

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:56.390
<i>humanity and the anisotropic.</i>

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.280
<i>Shindo Yukika.</i>

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:02.500
Impossible!

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.630
A child born between humanity 
and an anisotropic being?

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:07.110
<i>Well, zaShunina?</i>

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.650
<i>Was that enough to surprise you?</i>

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.700
Shindo!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.710
She's stopping it?

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.960
Without any Fregonics?

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:25.790
How?

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.170
You seem to be under a misapprehension.

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:31.660
Fregonics are not a perfect barrier.

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:35.790
Fregonics are simply a 
misunderstanding created when

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:39.590
the boundaries of the anisotropic and
the universe are forcibly connected.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:44.390
They appear because you're bad 
at manifesting in the universe.

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:48.400
So if one's understanding of the 
universe and anisotropic is complete,

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.690
there is no need for Fregonics.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:54.780
Kado!

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:00.290
Impossible!

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:03.810
She can't be better at controlling the 
anisotropic than an anisotropic being!

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:06.620
I don't have time to come 
up with a better method.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.530
I'll destroy the universe to get rid—

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:25.080
I am a singularity created by 
humanity and the anisotropic.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:28.420
I am a higher-dimensional being than you.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:32.890
But you know, I'm not the ending.

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.370
Yaha-kui zaShunina,

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:38.610
do you know what it means to advance?

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:42.900
It's to think of yourself as being
on the way to somewhere else.

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:45.120
Somewhere else...

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.070
Yes.

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:49.130
Humanity, the anisotropic,

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.300
me, and you...

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.300
We're all on the way to somewhere.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.950
So I'm on my way somewhere...

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:10.650
I'm just like you, aren't I, Shindo?

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.420
Shindo!

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:54.260
Farewell, Yaha-kui zaShunina.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.530
Is that...

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:05.910
Kado is...

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.580
...disappearing?

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.230
Shindo-kun...

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:16.840
What happened?

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:18.880
Stay focused!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.300
Our job hasn't changed.

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:23.560
Find out exactly what's going on,

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:26.930
and keep our citizens safe!

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:39.710
Shindo-san!

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:47.450
Yeah.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.160
Yukika.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:53.140
That's right, Dad.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:58.020
Something that goes beyond information...

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:05.230
He wasn't that bad a guy.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:43.880
Yukika

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:50.620
<b>One Month Later</b>

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:57.190
It's been exactly one month since the 
anisotropic being and Kado disappeared.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:04.120
There has been no further contact from 
Yaha-kui zaShunina, the anisotropic being.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.450
And with the disappearance of Kado,

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:12.280
all the Wam in the world have lost their power,

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:16.780
the sense of the anisotropic that 
was granted by the Sansa was lost,

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:21.050
and the Nanomis-hein suddenly disappeared.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:26.070
The three treasures given to us 
by the anisotropic have been lost.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:35.060
So everything the anisotropic 
gave us has been reset, huh?

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:37.560
Everyone...

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:39.610
Was it thanks to you?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:42.190
I don't have that power anymore.

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:45.610
I had her do it all.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.090
Amazing, right?

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:48.850
She's my daughter, you know!

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:50.620
She's Shindo-kun's daughter.

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:50.620
She's Shindo's daughter.

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:53.580
I raised her!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.620
It was really, really hard!

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:57.940
She never listens to me!

00:21:57.940 --> 00:21:59.380
And where is she?

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:00.580
Who knows?

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:02.220
"Who knows?"

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.160
She left before we really 
had a chance to talk.

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:09.810
Well, maybe telling her to stay here 
would have been unreasonable.

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:14.990
Because she, and we as her family,

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:17.230
are all on our way to somewhere.

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:23.610
However, not all was lost.

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:28.620
There is one great thing, the greatest thing,

00:22:28.620 --> 00:22:29.790
that is left to us.

00:22:30.980 --> 00:22:31.900
It is...

00:22:31.090 --> 00:22:32.430
Anisotropic

00:22:32.430 --> 00:22:35.410
the knowledge that the anisotropic exists.

00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:41.390
We have learned of the higher-dimensional 
world known as the anisotropic,

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:40.920
Back Later

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:43.410
Back Later

00:22:41.970 --> 00:22:45.420
and of the frontier of advancement 
that stretches out before us.

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:50.930
So don't you think it's time 
that humanity went to see

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:54.460
Yaha-kui zaShunina on our own two legs?

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:00.110
Preparing
to Open

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:19.260
That which goes beyond information...
